      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Braintree%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1675, the town was the site of Wheeler’s Surprise, a clash between colonial soldiers and Nipmuc warriors during King Philip’s War.",
